@* The look the BitSortable pages give their lists: trays of cards of one size, side by side, so a drag aimed at a card
   lands in its slot (BitSortableE2ETestBase aims every drag at a slot), and every list of a page fits the 1280 x 1400
   viewport the tests drive it in, since a native drag cannot be aimed below the fold. Nothing here restyles the
   component's own states (bit-srt-*): the tests read those off the component's stylesheet. *@
<style>
    .srt-cols {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: stretch;
        max-width: 960px;
    }

    .srt-col {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-width: 0;
    }

    .srt-col > .demo-list {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: none;
    }

    .srt-col-title {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .demo-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        max-width: 520px;
        min-height: 56px;
        padding: 8px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background: #f4f4f4;
        border: 1px solid #c8c8c8;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .demo-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 44px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #c8c8c8;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .demo-item.tinted {
        border-color: #7fb0dc;
    }

    .demo-ghost {
        border-style: dashed !important;
        border-color: #1276c6 !important;
    }

    .demo-order {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    .handle {
        margin-inline-end: 10px;
        padding: 0 2px;
        cursor: grab;
        user-select: none;
    }

    .touch-handle {
        touch-action: none;
    }

    .demo-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(90px, 1fr));
        gap: 10px;
        max-width: 520px;
    }

    .threshold-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        max-width: 300px;
    }

    .grid-square {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 90px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #0f5f9e;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nested-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        min-height: 40px;
        padding: 7px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        border: 1px dashed #7fb0dc;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    #nested-root {
        max-width: 640px;
    }

    .nested-item {
        padding: 8px 8px 9px;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #c8c8c8;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .nested-item__name {
        margin: 0 0 6px 3px;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .large-panel {
        max-height: 520px;
        overflow: auto;
        border: 1px solid #c8c8c8;
        border-radius: 8px;
